y}^{″}=-c{y}^{′}-ky.\n$$\n\nSubstituting our values for $m,$ $k$ and $c$ gives\n\n$$\n2{y}^{″}=-4{y}^{′}-10y.\n$$\n\nRearranging the above equation, we get:\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+5y=0\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-79570/selection/fa4eaa07200274f30fac14a749869db17c8685c48a1aa0ac060a3e1d1a4c1cdf" :answer/id #uuid "b4773025-9a76-5a31-a08e-ff94e02a6eff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}+9y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79570/selection/e2ce6e9f7430c3fff6fc71e626bf7236dcbe779aa6e1413078fa419697be6e77" :answer/id #uuid "1bc1b9a1-4eb3-542b-9375-d7e5c5bc6c92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79570/selection/d315ff240bd634966ad532f977a5e568b0488ec7fcbb5b6f9aa27fa7ef11033e" :answer/id #uuid "54e25263-a4f2-5ae3-8592-1e8a031333b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+3y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79570/selection/c4e118a041a0e619b85446c859ff172a3fb342145ca138611f3e4326be01b9b4" :answer/id #uuid "f4a9bb00-4f2e-58db-8068-af2adac965a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}+3y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79570/selection/712bd64e8e116475c18463866524228b0d5dc59c584080dc7e6d8dd124a89960" :answer/id #uuid "eeb439f7-6139-587d-8c92-791296d0512f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+9y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79570/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0c14214d-b8ed-55a8-a768-0b75dd1b4df7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-79570/selection/fa4eaa07200274f30fac14a749869db17c8685c48a1aa0ac060a3e1d1a4c1cdf" :answer-field/choices ["q-79570/selection/fa4eaa07200274f30fac14a749869db17c8685c48a1aa0ac060a3e1d1a4c1cdf" "q-79570/selection/e2ce6e9f7430c3fff6fc71e626bf7236dcbe779aa6e1413078fa419697be6e77" "q-79570/selection/d31